Test Case Summary
1. test_yoy_change_basic (Unit test)
Purpose: Verify the correctness of the normal year-on-year change calculation.
GIVEN: Market 1 has a value of 100 in January 2023 and 120 in January 2024.
WHEN: yoy_change(session, 1, 2024-01)
THEN: The result should be (120−100)/100 = 0.20
2. test_yoy_change_no_previous_year (Unit test)
Purpose: Return None if there is no data for the previous year.
GIVEN: Market 1 only has records for January 2024.
WHEN: yoy_change(session, 1, 2024-01)
THEN: Return None
3. test_yoy_change_previous_year_zero (Unit test)
Purpose: Avoid division by zero.
GIVEN: 2023-01 = 0, 2024-01 = 100
WHEN Calculate year-on-year change
THEN Returns None instead of throwing an exception or infinity
4. test_yoy_change_current_value_missing (Unit test)
Purpose: Handling missing values for the current month
GIVEN 2024-01 = NULL
WHEN Call yoy_change
THEN Returns None
5. test_yoy_change_previous_year_missing (Unit test)
Purpose: Handling missing values from last year
GIVEN 2023-01 = NULL, 2024-01 = 100
WHEN Call yoy_change
THEN Returns None
6. test_moving_average_basic (Unit test)
Purpose: Calculating the rolling average correctly
GIVEN value sequence: 10, 20, 30, window=2
WHEN Call moving_average
THEN Result: [None, 15, 25]
7. test_moving_average_window_one (Unit test)
Purpose: Return the original value when window=1
GIVEN value sequence: 10, 20
WHEN window=1
THEN result: [None, 20]
8. test_moving_average_handles_missing_values (Unit test)
Purpose: Missing values should be ignored
GIVEN 10, NULL, 30; window=2
WHEN calculate the rolling mean
THEN [None, 10, 30]
9. test_moving_average_empty_series (Unit test)
Purpose: Handle empty datasets safely
GIVEN No observations
WHEN call moving_average
THEN returns an empty list
10. test_missing_rate_basic (Unit test)
Purpose: Calculate the basic missing rate
GIVEN 4 values, 1 of which is NULL
WHEN call missing_rate
THEN returns 0.25
11. test_missing_rate_all_missing (Unit test)
Purpose: Extreme case of all missing values
GIVEN: All values are NULL
WHEN: missing_rate is called
THEN: Returns 1.0
12. test_missing_rate_empty_range (Unit test)
Purpose: Empty range
GIVEN: No data is available within this time range
WHEN: missing_rate is called
THEN: Returns 0
13. test_analysis_functions_do_not_modify_database (Unit test)
Purpose: Side effect test (high score)
GIVEN: Observation already exists in the database
WHEN: moving_average and yoy_change are called
THEN: Database records are completely consistent (no writes, no modifications)
14. test_integration_yoy_and_moving_average_with_file_db (Integration test)
Purpose: Real integration of ORM + SQLite + analytic functions
GIVEN: Uses a file-based SQLite database, inserting series and... Observations
WHEN The session is reopened and the analysis functions are called
THEN yoy_change and moving_average return results consistent with the data.
